    │
 14 │ struct Gap<A = i64, B> {
    │            ───┬───  ┬
    │               ╰──────── a default here
    │                     │
    │                     ╰── needs a default
    │
    │ Note: a use leaves out type arguments from the end, so the parameters with defaults come last
