[E0216] Error: the default of `A` rests on itself
    ╭─[ err/290_default_type_arguments/main.wip:22:19 ]
    │
 22 │ struct Itself<A = Itself> {
    │                   ───┬──
    │                      ╰──── leaves out a type argument whose default is this one
